WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:04.440
Upon learning that the battle royal was 
merely a test to choose members

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.600
of the Academia-fighting duel 
warriors known as "Lancers,"

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.190
Yuya was enraged, challenging Reiji Akaba to a duel.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:12.520
I'll do it!

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.900
In place of Yuzu and the others, 
who were turned into cards,

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.560
I'll bring you to your knees!

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:21.030
Finish it! Go, Beast-Eyes!

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.640
Hell Dive Burst!

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.000
What?

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:35.370
The Lancers are a battle squad 
meant to fight Academia.

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:40.330
You must learn that weakness in a 
real battle could cost you your life!

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:42.490
I have no intention of joining the Lancers!

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:45.960
You do not want to save Yuzu Hiiragi?

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:48.390
What?

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:49.880
You're saying

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:52.300
Yuzu is alive?

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:59.340
Implementing mass into Solid Vision 
has created Action Duels.

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:04.080
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:07.140
the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:45.980
Raise the Flag of Rebellion 
Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.750
You're saying Yuzu is alive?

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:54.720
She was taken by the Obelisk Force?

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.860
You're saying you saw that?

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:00.390
What's that Fuma ninja doing?

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:02.250
Orders from the president!

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:04.120
Do not let Academia take Serena!

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:06.500
No, that is not Serena.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.130
You can tell from her movement.

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:10.800
That is Yuzu Hiiragi.

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:13.510
I don't know why,

00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:16.210
but they changed clothes and traded places.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:24.580
What?

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:28.250
That's a duelist from the Synchro Dimension!

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:37.080
They disappeared!

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:40.580
Clearly, Yuzu Hiiragi was not turned into a card.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.910
Most likely, she wasn't taken to Academia, either.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:47.590
But I can't tell him that now.

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:52.040
If you want to destroy Academia 
and save Yuzu Hiiragi,

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:54.680
you must first surpass me!

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:59.750
Is Reiji saying he wants to let 
that hostile, little Yuya Sakaki

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:03.060
into the Lancers?

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:04.990
He is the originator of Pendulum.

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:08.460
He will be needed in the battle against Academia.

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:14.150
Pendulum Summoning no longer 
belongs exclusively to him.

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:19.290
My turn. Draw!

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:26.170
I set the Pendulum Scale with 
Scale 1 D/D Savant Galilei

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:28.150
and Scale 10 Savant Keplar!

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:34.060
Now, I can simultaneously summon 
monsters between Levels 2 and 9.

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:38.890
Here it comes... Reiji Akaba's Pendulum Summon!

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:42.530
The great power that shakes my soul,

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.550
reside in my body

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:47.400
and become the new light that cuts 
through the darkness!

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:49.130
Pendulum Summon!

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:54.140
Show yourself, ultimate deity who casts 
judgment on the twilight of the gods,

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:58.540
D/D/D Oblivion King Abyss Ragnarok!

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:06.860
When this card is successfully Special Summoned,

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:11.290
I can Special Summon one D/D/D 
monster in my graveyard.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:15.690
Return, D/D/D Wave King Caesar!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.960
Abyss Ragnarok has 2200 attack points.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.400
Caesar has 2400 attack points.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:25.440
Even with two D/D/D Monsters together,

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:28.370
they still can't beat my dragons.

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:32.840
I Normal Summon D/D Necro Slime from my hand!

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:38.420
And I activate Abyss Ragnarok's monster effect.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:41.650
By tributing D/D Necro Slime,

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:45.660
I can banish one monster on the field.

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:49.460
I choose to banish Rune-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:50.300
What?

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:55.150
Damn...

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:57.170
But he still has Beast-Eyes!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:01.910
I activate the effect of D/D Necro Slime in my graveyard.

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:04.520
By banishing this card,

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:07.300
I can Fusion Summon a D/D/D Monster!

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:09.280
Reiji Akaba...

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:10.880
...can also do Pendulum Fusion?

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:16.010
I choose to fuse Oblivion King Abyss 
Ragnarok and Wave King Caesar.

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:18.800
Break through the twilight of the gods,

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:22.640
and use the power of surging waves 
to open a new world!

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:24.800
Fusion Summon!

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:28.270
Come before us, dictator of the upper limits!

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:32.860
D/D/D Wave Oblivion King Caesar Ragnarok!

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:35.610
3200 attack points?

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:39.840
In that instant, the effect of Wave King Caesar,

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:42.680
sent to the graveyard as a fusion 
component, activates.

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:48.150
I add one Dark Contract from my deck to my hand!

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:48.950
Battle.

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:52.730
I attack Beast-Eyes Pendulum Dragon

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:55.860
with Wave Oblivion King Caesar Ragnarok!

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:58.860
The End of Judgment!

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:05.270
Beast-Eyes!

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:08.740
He lost Rune-Eyes and his other Fusion Dragon, too!

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:11.940
And now, my darling's field is wide-open...

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:15.400
This is you getting serious?

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:16.610
What did you say?

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:19.850
I don't think you're showing me everything you have.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:24.320
I'm not showing you everything I have, either.

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:26.060
Not in the least.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:29.390
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:31.860
Now, it is your turn.

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:35.100
If you want to make me give everything I have,

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:38.880
you should show me all of yourself, 
without hesitation or regret.

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:42.070
Has Yuzu been taken by Academia?

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:44.360
If you know, tell me!

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:47.080
If you want to know, defeat me.

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:48.210
What?

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:51.050
Weren't you going to send me to my knees?

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:54.060
Are you saying you don't care

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:56.720
what happens to the friends that 
were turned into cards,

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:57.990
so long as Yuzu is safe?

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:18.330
Darling!

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:19.180
Yuya!

00:08:19.570 --> 00:08:20.480
Why?

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:24.140
Why is Reiji Akaba provoking Yuya to this degree?

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:31.420
My turn!

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:36.560
Swing once more, my soul's pendulum!

00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:39.530
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:41.330
Pendulum Summon!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:44.440
Return from my Extra Deck!

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:47.690
Stargazer Magician!

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:51.510
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:59.870
And I Normal Summon Performapal 
Pendulum Sorcerer from my hand!

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:05.140
Xiangsheng Magician's Pendulum Effect...

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:08.210
Once per turn, I can change the level of one monster

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:11.060
I choose, to match that of a different monster!

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.970
I raise Stargazer Magician to Level 4,

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:20.040
the same level as Performapal Pendulum Sorcerer!

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:22.610
Now, there are two Level 4s?

00:09:23.030 --> 00:09:26.000
I overlay Level 4 Stargazer Magician

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.810
and Performapal Pendulum Magician!

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.120
From the black darkness,

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:38.590
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:40.790
Xyz Summon!

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:44.960
Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.590
Ute's dragon...

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.200
Good.

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:57.410
I activate Dark Rebellion Xyz 
Dragon's monster effect!

00:09:57.970 --> 00:09:59.910
I use one Overlay Unit.

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:01.360
Until the end of my turn,

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:04.380
Caesar Ragnarok's attack points are halved,

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:09.110
and Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon's attack points 
are increased by the same amount.

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:13.730
Treason Discharge!

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:16.730
I use one more Overlay Unit!

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:18.200
Yuya...

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:20.600
Treason Discharge!

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.400
Increasing it to 4100...

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:27.170
This has gotta finish it!

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:33.670
Battle! I attack Caesar Ragnarok with 
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:37.880
Lightning Disobey of Rebellion!

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:41.120
I activate Caesar Ragnarok's effect!

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:45.530
I return D/D Savant Keplar to my hand,

00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:49.790
to equip one monster on your side 
of the field to Caesar Ragnarok,

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:53.900
adding its attack points to those of Caesar Ragnarok!

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:58.940
I choose to equip Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:03.210
Odd-Eyes!

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:19.890
I set one card and end my turn.

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:24.280
In that instant, Dark Rebellion's 
attack points return to normal.

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:27.240
That was brilliant.

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:27.830
What?

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:32.570
You've shown me one more thing 
that lies beyond your Pendulum.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:38.540
If Pendulum Fusion was born of 
your bond with Yuzu Hiiragi,

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:42.280
whose bond was that Pendulum Xyz born of?

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:46.600
No matter...

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:49.490
Soon enough, it will surely become clear.

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:53.340
Now, it is my turn.

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:02.000
My turn.

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:07.820
My set D/D Savant Galilei's Pendulum Effect

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:10.940
lets me increase its scale from 1 to 3.

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:15.660
I set Level 10 D/D Savant Keplar, 
returned to my hand,

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:17.260
on the scale once again!

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:23.850
This allows me to summon monsters between 
Levels 4 and 9 simultaneously!

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:27.660
The great power that shakes my soul,

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:31.760
reside in my body and become the new 
light that cuts through the darkness!

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:33.430
Pendulum Summon!

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:34.650
Be reborn...

00:12:36.600 --> 00:12:40.490
D/D/D Oblivion King Abyss Ragnarok!

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:45.740
And from my hand, I summon D/D/D 
Doom King Armageddon!

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:49.590
That's...

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.450
During their last fight,

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:55.450
that monster is what drove Yuya to the brink.

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:02.340
I activate my trap card Wings of Misdirection!

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:06.480
Until the end of my turn, I negate 
the activation of monster effects,

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:09.680
as well as spell and trap cards 
on your side of the field,

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:13.640
and increase the attack points of 
one monster on my field by 800!

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:18.010
Dark Rebellion's attack points are now higher 
than those of Doom King Armageddon!

00:13:18.010 --> 00:13:20.480
He's even sealed his set cards!

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:23.980
I'll drive you even further.

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:28.750
I overlay Level 8 Oblivion King Abyss Ragnarok

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:32.490
and Doom King Armageddon!

00:13:35.490 --> 00:13:36.620
What?

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.170
Reiji is also going from Pendulum...

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:39.460
...to Xyz?

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:47.140
When the two suns rise,

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:49.680
the order of a new world is revealed.

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:52.080
Xyz Summon!

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:53.950
Come before us,

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:58.260
Rank 8 D/D/D Duo-Dawn King Kali Yuga!

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:03.020
3500 attack points?

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:06.170
When I successfully Special Summon this card,

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:10.490
I negate all card effects except Kali 
Yuga's, until the end of my turn!

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:11.500
What?

00:14:16.530 --> 00:14:19.340
Dark Rebellion's attack points are back to normal...

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:20.750
Battle!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:25.820
I attack Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon 
with Duo-Dawn King Kali Yuga.

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:27.990
Twin Break Shot!

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:44.760
Yuya!

00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:45.760
Darling!

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:48.890
I now end my turn.

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:52.240
What's wrong? Finished already?

00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:56.090
What happened to your bold proclamation 
that you'd bring me to my knees?

00:14:57.210 --> 00:15:00.180
Aren't you going to make me regret my actions?

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:02.110
I can't watch anymore...

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:03.450
I'll help you!

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:04.650
Stay out of my way!

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:10.420
This is my duel...

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:12.420
Mine, Yuzu's,

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:14.090
and Ute's!

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:15.790
Ute?

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:21.240
I'll do... whatever it takes to save Yuzu!

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:23.440
Darling...

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:24.440
Yuya...

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:27.910
And I'll keep my promise to Ute!

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:31.930
Use your power to bring smiles

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:35.960
to the world and the future.

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:39.440
That's why I can't afford to lose!

00:15:39.440 --> 00:15:42.120
Not to someone who made us 
fight to please themselves...

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:45.080
Not to someone who used duels to hurt people...

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:47.360
I can't afford to lose!

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:50.900
My turn!

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:54.300
I'll win!

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:57.800
I'll beat you with the card Ute entrusted to me!

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.540
When there are no monsters on my field,

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:04.280
I can activate spell card Shuffle Reborn from my hand!

00:16:05.510 --> 00:16:10.500
I negate Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon's 
effect to Special Summon it!

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:14.540
It's back!

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:15.560
Yeah!

00:16:16.340 --> 00:16:19.470
And the effect of Shuffle Reborn

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:22.790
lets me return Performapal 
Trump Witch to my deck,

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:26.230
and draw a card!

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:27.100
It's here.

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:31.500
I set Scale 3 Xiangke Magician

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:36.470
and Scale 8 Xiangsheng Magician 
on the Pendulum Scale!

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:48.020
Now, I can summon monsters between 
Levels 4 and 7 simultaneously!

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:50.990
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:53.580
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:55.840
Pendulum Summon!

00:16:55.840 --> 00:16:57.900
Be reborn once more!

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:01.690
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:09.840
And I activate Xiangke Magician's Pendulum Effect!

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:15.130
Once per turn, I can bestow one Xyz Monster

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:17.080
with a level equal to its rank!

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:25.220
I turn Rank 4 Xyz Dark Rebellion to a Level 4!

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:32.100
He gave an Xyz Monster a level?

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:36.650
I activate Xiangsheng Magician's Pendulum Effect.

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:39.620
I bestow the selected monster with a level

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:42.270
equal to that of another monster!

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:47.460
I give Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon's level

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:49.850
to Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon...

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:50.980
Level 7!

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:52.400
That means...

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:54.450
He has two Level 7 monsters.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:56.920
Here it comes...

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:59.920
I overlay Level 7 Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon

00:18:00.630 --> 00:18:04.160
and Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:08.630
Dragon with different-colored eyes,

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:13.840
exterminate your enemies with your black wrath!

00:18:14.310 --> 00:18:15.570
Xyz Summon!

00:18:15.850 --> 00:18:17.820
Come out, Rank 7...

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:20.030
With shining eyes of fury!

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:23.820
Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon!

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:31.670
This is it...

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:34.490
What I wanted to see.

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:39.390
I activate my trap card Wings of 
Misdirection from my graveyard!

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:44.860
This card lets me banish Xiangsheng 
Magician and Xiangke Magician

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:50.040
to increase Odd-Eyes Rebellion 
Dragon's attack points by 800!

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:53.160
At the same time, until the end of my turn,

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:57.050
I negate your monster effects and set-card activation!

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:00.620
The effect of Duo-Dawn King Kali Yuga activates!

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:05.090
Its monster effect cannot be negated 
by other card effects!

00:19:05.090 --> 00:19:07.320
That won't save you!

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:10.540
Kali Yuga's attack points are still just 3500.

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:13.600
Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon's are 3800!

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:16.570
And your set cards are sealed!

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:17.860
Battle!

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:21.040
Go, Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon!

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:29.350
Wrath of Rebellion...

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:31.930
Strike Disobey!

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:35.550
I activate Kali Yuga's effect!

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:38.060
I use one Overlay Unit

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:41.190
to destroy all spell and trap cards on the field!

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:44.900
Then I use its remaining Overlay Unit

00:19:44.900 --> 00:19:47.700
to restore my own set cards to my side of the field.

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:51.080
Wings of Misdirection's effect

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:54.600
only targets cards on the field during its activation.

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:58.320
Now, my cards can be activated.

00:19:58.320 --> 00:20:01.730
I activate my trap Dark Contract with Errors!

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:05.100
It lets me negate a currently 
activated spell card's effect.

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:09.790
I negate the effect of Wings of Misdirection!

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:16.270
And I activate one more trap!

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:18.230
Dark Contract with Renewal!

00:20:18.840 --> 00:20:22.230
The effect of Wings of Misdirection, 
which I just negated...

00:20:22.230 --> 00:20:24.200
I now activate, myself!

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:25.700
What?!

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:29.130
With the effect of Wings of Misdirection,

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:33.460
I increase the attack points of 
Duo-Dawn King Kali Yuga by 800!

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:36.380
The battle goes through.

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:37.620
Now, Kali Yuga...

00:20:38.030 --> 00:20:42.150
Strike back against Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon!

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:06.600
No...

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:07.660
Yuya...

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:12.200
You really are soft.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:16.920
You cannot save Yuzu Hiiragi that way!

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:21.030
But you are not without promise.

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:24.040
That goes for the rest of you 
battle-royal survivors, as well!

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:27.550
Having the power of Pendulum Summon

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:30.270
puts you on the level of LDS's current top team.

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:33.970
That is why I've decided to let you join the Lancers

00:21:34.430 --> 00:21:36.900
and travel the dimensions with me.

00:21:38.530 --> 00:21:40.000
Travel the dimensions?

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:46.700
Did you get the data on this duel?

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:48.390
It's all been recorded.

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:51.210
I see. Good work.

00:21:56.200 --> 00:21:58.020
I'm not ready yet.

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:00.410
I need to become stronger...

00:22:01.270 --> 00:22:04.100
stronger than I am right now...

00:22:05.280 --> 00:22:07.300
I will save Yuzu!

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:12.300
Yuzu!

00:23:52.290 --> 00:23:54.740
I'll save Yuzu, no matter what.

00:23:55.310 --> 00:23:58.620
As a member of the Lancers, 
I'll become stronger than before...

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:00.170
I'll beat all my enemies!

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:02.110
Beat your enemies?

00:24:02.110 --> 00:24:03.720
Does that include Sora?

00:24:04.850 --> 00:24:05.940
That's...

00:24:06.440 --> 00:24:09.660
I'm asking if you're gonna beat Sora, damn it!

00:24:11.400 --> 00:24:15.430
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Be Reborn, Legendary Gang Boss!!

00:24:16.130 --> 00:24:18.060
The fun is only getting started!
